WEBVTT

00:00:00.351 --> 00:00:07.944
When the canvas dropdown is long, its lower end used to run under the small map at the bottom left. Entries and their buttons were hidden behind it.

00:00:08.897 --> 00:00:16.873
Now the dropdown opens above the map. The same list is complete, down to the last entry and its Approve button, and the map stays tucked behind it.
